    "name": {
      "value": "Trailblazer"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lopsg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Uncharted realms have always intrigued you, and you've explored and mapped large territories in service to merchants, governments, or your own curiosity. Where some see a blank spot on a map, you see the potential for something new and undiscovered.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Cartography Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Terrain Expertise skill feat with one terrain you've explored (such as forest or underground)."
    },
